flowchart TD
  Place[Grid placement / actual footprint validation] --> Site[ConstructionService site identity]
  Site --> Ghost[Persistent visual: hologram / corner tape and pylons]
  Delivery[Actual hauling deposit of partial M11] --> Budget[Local material-supported work ceiling]
  Builders[Exclusive present builders] --> Work[Earned construction work]
  Budget --> Work
  Work --> Consume[Incremental real M11 consumption]
  Work --> Event[Keyed site progress/state event]
  Event --> Reveal[Bottom-up solid / ghost remainder / orange outline]
  Work -->|full work and material cost once| Complete[Actual usable facility]
  Complete --> Scissors[Fade / swoop / snip four tape midpoints / fade]
  Scissors --> Fall[Finite cosmetic tape physics]
  Fall -->|ground contact| Pylons[Grow0.5s then shrink0.25s / cleanup]
  Cancel[Cancel site] --> Recover[Actual consumed loss / recover unconsumed goods]
  Cancel --> Cleanup[Remove visuals without celebration]
  Speed[Existing Pause /1x /2x; normal startup1x] --> Work
  Speed --> Scissors
  Speed --> Fall
  Speed --> Pylons
